# Rewind: double esc opens the message selector.
name: rewind
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
files: fixtures/app
script: scripts/rewind.json
parity: SE-22
---
ready
type first message
keys enter
wait_for 30s First reply.
type second message
keys enter
wait_for 30s Second reply.
settle
keys esc esc
settle 3s
checkpoint selector
keys esc
settle
